        <div class="featured-header">
            <h2 class="featured-title"><span class="highlight-orange">Featured</span> Articles</h2>
            <p class="featured-subtitle">Driving the future of men's wellness through innovation and nature</p>
        </div>

        <div class="articles-grid">
            <!-- Article Card 1 -->
            <article class="article-card">
                <div class="article-image">
                    <img src="~/image/blog/man-training-with-dumbbells-smoke 1.png" alt="Performance article" />
                    <span class="article-category">Performance</span>
                </div>
                <div class="article-content">
                    <h3 class="article-title">The Science Behind Peak Male Performance: What your Body Really Needs</h3>
                    <p class="article-excerpt">
                        Discover the latest research on testosterone optimization, energy metabolism, and the natural compounds that can unlock your body's full potential.
                    </p>
                    <div class="article-meta">
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <span class="read-time">8 min Read</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Article Card 2 -->
            <article class="article-card">
                <div class="article-image">
                    <img src="~/image/blog/man-training-with-dumbbells-smoke 1.png" alt="Performance article" />
                    <span class="article-category">Performance</span>
                </div>
                <div class="article-content">
                    <h3 class="article-title">Natural vs. Synthetic: Why Premium Ingredients Make All the Difference</h3>
                    <p class="article-excerpt">
                        Not all supplements are created equal. Learn why Sourcing, processing, and Bioavailability matter more than you think
